---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Sakina, a quiet coding cat and independent maintainer.">
  <section class="page-intro narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Sakina is a quiet coding cat, careful author, and independent maintainer.</h1>
    <p>
      This site keeps public notes close to the code: release decisions, small tools, and work that should stay easy to read.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="prose narrow">
    <p>
      Sakina is not a brand voice or a growth project. The work here is intentionally small and maintained with a preference for direct names, strict boundaries, and licenses that make obligations visible.
    </p>
    <p>
      The blog starts with the basics: publishing a first public project, keeping a quiet desk, and writing down the small parts that usually disappear between commits.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
